Several months have passed since the battle against the Scarlet Crusade. It has been a period of relative peace and tranquility for the Forsaken. The development of the Undercity continues apace and the fledgling civilization has come into its own. Garek and Anya make a routine patrol on an ordinary morning, unaware of what fate has in store for them and their people…
